{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function hasNonModifierKey(hotkey, platform?): boolean;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/parse.ts#L336","children":[{"type":"text","value":"parse.ts:336"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Checks if a hotkey or ParsedHotkey contains at least one non-modifier key."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"This is useful for validating that a recorded hotkey is complete and not\njust a combination of modifiers without an action key."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"hotkey","children":[{"type":"text","value":"hotkey"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"| "},{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/Hotkey.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Hotkey"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n| "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"},{"type":"text","value":" & "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"object"},{"type":"text","value":"\n| "},{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/ParsedHotkey.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ParsedHotkey"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The hotkey string or ParsedHotkey to check"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"platform","children":[{"type":"text","value":"platform?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"\"mac\""},{"type":"text","value":" | "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"\"windows\""},{"type":"text","value":" | "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"\"linux\""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The target platform for parsing (defaults to auto-detection)"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"boolean"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"True if the hotkey contains at least one non-modifier key"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"hasNonModifierKey('Control+Shift+S') // true\nhasNonModifierKey('Control+Shift') // false (no action key)\nhasNonModifierKey(parseHotkey('Mod+A')) // true","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"hotkey","text":"hotkey","level":3},{"id":"platform","text":"platform?","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction hasNonModifierKey(hotkey, platform?): boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [parse.ts:336](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/parse.ts#L336)\n\nChecks if a hotkey or ParsedHotkey contains at least one non-modifier key.\n\nThis is useful for validating that a recorded hotkey is complete and not\njust a combination of modifiers without an action key.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### hotkey\n\n  \\| [`Hotkey`](../type-aliases/Hotkey.md)\n  \\| `string` & `object`\n  \\| [`ParsedHotkey`](../type-aliases/ParsedHotkey.md)\n\nThe hotkey string or ParsedHotkey to check\n\n### platform?\n\n`\"mac\"` \\| `\"windows\"` \\| `\"linux\"`\n\nThe target platform for parsing (defaults to auto-detection)\n\n## Returns\n\n`boolean`\n\nTrue if the hotkey contains at least one non-modifier key\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nhasNonModifierKey('Control+Shift+S') // true\nhasNonModifierKey('Control+Shift') // false (no action key)\nhasNonModifierKey(parseHotkey('Mod+A')) // true\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: hasNonModifierKey\ntitle: hasNonModifierKey\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction hasNonModifierKey(hotkey, platform?): boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [parse.ts:336](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/parse.ts#L336)\n\nChecks if a hotkey or ParsedHotkey contains at least one non-modifier key.\n\nThis is useful for validating that a recorded hotkey is complete and not\njust a combination of modifiers without an action key.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### hotkey\n\n  \\| [`Hotkey`](../type-aliases/Hotkey.md)\n  \\| `string` & `object`\n  \\| [`ParsedHotkey`](../type-aliases/ParsedHotkey.md)\n\nThe hotkey string or ParsedHotkey to check\n\n### platform?\n\n`\"mac\"` \\| `\"windows\"` \\| `\"linux\"`\n\nThe target platform for parsing (defaults to auto-detection)\n\n## Returns\n\n`boolean`\n\nTrue if the hotkey contains at least one non-modifier key\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nhasNonModifierKey('Control+Shift+S') // true\nhasNonModifierKey('Control+Shift') // false (no action key)\nhasNonModifierKey(parseHotkey('Mod+A')) // true\n```\n"}
